Falsifies `address_space_map::verification::the_bands_are_listed_in_address_order`.

The defect: `BANDS` lists `HEAP` before `RUNTIME_WINDOWS`. Every address still lies in exactly
one band, so the membership harness stays green; only the order is wrong. The `const` tiling
assert in `lib.rs` would stop the build first, so the patch deletes it as well.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert!(band_index(low) <= band_index(high))`.

diff --git a/crates/address_space_map/src/lib.rs b/crates/address_space_map/src/lib.rs
index 0eba0def7..2a1284ac0 100644
